# Application Layer

`source/main.tsx` is the browser entrypoint. It finds `#root`, creates the React root, and renders `App`.

`source/app.tsx` composes application-wide providers and the router. It currently mounts `SessionProvider` around `AppRouter`.

Keep these files small and composition-only. Global providers and bootstrapping belong here; route decisions, feature state, and screen markup belong in their dedicated layers.

`source/index.css` is the application stylesheet entrypoint. It imports Tailwind and the shared React theme. Global tokens belong in the shared theme or this entrypoint, not inside feature blocks.

`source/env.d.ts` contains type-only environment declarations.
